FarIntel v1.0 for Windows 95/98/NT
FAR plugin 
~~~~~~~~~~
- allows to use wheel of Microsoft IntelliMouse or 
  Logitech WheelMouse in File and Archive Manager 
  (FAR) as well in any console applications.

